{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Webflux Assignment",
    "description": "API collection for Spring Boot WebFlux basic auth with email OTP verification and JWT tokens.\n\nFlow:\n1. Register with email \u2192 OTP is logged in app console (mail.host=log)\n2. Verify email with GET /auths/verify-email?verifyOTP={otp}\n3. Login with Basic Auth header \u2192 returns JWT access & refresh tokens\n4. Use Bearer token or Basic Auth to call user endpoints\n5. Forget password \u2192 GET token from logs \u2192 POST /auths/reset-password\n\nOTP expires in 5 minutes.\n\nPre-seeded Accounts:\n- Admin (ADMIN): admin / admin12345\n- John Doe (USER): JohnDoe / kX9#mQ2$vL7p",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
